### TEST REQUESTS: VIETMART SEARCH SERVICE A/B TESTING
### ==============================================================================
### Gateway Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### 1. Gọi thử nghiệm API tìm kiếm qua API Gateway
### Kỳ vọng: ~80% trả về 'V1', ~20% trả về 'V2'
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search?keyword=dien_thoai_samsung
Accept: text/plain

###

### 2. Gọi API tìm kiếm chi tiết trả về JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search/detail?keyword=iphone_15
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Kiểm tra trực tiếp instance V1 (Port 8081)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/search
Accept: text/plain

###

### 4. Kiểm tra trực tiếp instance V2 (Port 8082)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search
Accept: text/plain
